@startuml
title 07 - Master Management Blocks (Overview)
autonumber

actor "Frontend / Postman" as FE
participant "Gateway :8099" as GW
participant "Setting Service :8092" as SET
database "Setting DB" as SDB

group 1) Company (COMM)
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/setting/companies/*
  GW -> SET: Forward
  SET -> SDB: CRUD + filter + reference
  SET --> FE: response
end

group 2) Module/Section/Page/Task (MODM/SECM/PAGM/TASM)
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/setting/modules/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/setting/sections/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/setting/pages/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/setting/tasks/*
  GW -> SET: Forward
  SET -> SDB: Local CRUD/filter/reference
  SET --> FE: response
end

group 3) Role + Policies (USRM/PSPM/UNPM)
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/setting/roles/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/setting/password-policy/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/setting/username-policy/*
  GW -> SET: Forward
  SET -> SDB: CRUD/filter/reference
  SET --> FE: response
end

group 4) User-Company + Company-Module
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/setting/user-companies/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/setting/company-modules/*
  GW -> SET: Forward
  SET -> SDB: Mapping + subscription management
  SET --> FE: response
end

note bottom
Detailed split diagrams:
- 07a-company-management.puml
- 07b-module-management.puml
- 07c-section-management.puml
- 07d-page-management.puml
- 07e-task-management.puml
- 07f-role-and-policy-management.puml
- 07g-user-company-management.puml
- 07h-company-module-subscription.puml
end note

@enduml
